        "datePublished": "2026-02-25",
        "name": "Easy to assemble, looks good",
        "reviewBody": "I don't understand the negative reviews.  I have six of these, and each was a breeze to attach to the walls.  No, IKEA does not provide the wall screws because each wall is different:  plywood?  drywall?  brick?  concrete?  Do a little bit of homework on what material your wall is made of before blaming IKEA.  Assuming you use the proper screws, these shelves can support quite a bit, and they look sleek at the same time.",
